[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Economy/ShopResource.cs" id="1_shop"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Economy/ShopStockEntry.cs" id="2_entry"]

; Tobin Rusk, Last Hearth's scavenger (the Ashen Wilds). The settlement's one counter, so he buys
; everything (no AcceptedTags): a realm with no general buyer makes its own loot unsellable. What he
; sells is what comes back over the Breach and out of the ruins. Dear to buy, mean to sell to: he is
; the only trader for a day's walk and knows it.

